A total of (12) integrated awareness campaigns on the prevention and early intervention measures to curb social-ills amongst children and youth were conducted in the following campuses namely, 

GP: University of Pretoria (Ondersteport and Hatfield campuses);
EC: Baffalo City Campus.

KZN: Mangosuthu University of Technology, Durban University of Technology (Nelson Mandela and Ripston campuses);

LP: University of Limpopo and University of Venda;

MP: Gert Sibande TVET College (Sibanesetfu, Standerton Skills Academy and   
Standerton Campuses)

WC: University of Cape Town
